                                                "example_id": "8156a75f-108d-4db0-a4be-1ced43e63b41",
                                                "sense_id": "95e385dc-4e09-37a5-928b-b03470b5987d",
                                                "text": "While we might have a tendency to romanticize the past, the reality is that cooking was often a monotonous, arduous, thankless task required to keep the family fed."
